      "date": "2026-10-20T17:51:07Z",
      "created": "2026-10-20T17:47:23Z",
      "kind": "patch",
      "prerelease": false,
      "notes": "- Room name: call each radio \"Kitchen\", \"Living\"... (Settings -> About this\n  radio). It shows in the room list, the page title and Home Assistant; the\n  page address stays the same. Optional: \"Use the room name for casting\"\n  makes AirPlay, Spotify, UPnP and Bluetooth \"Hasler Kitchen\".\n- Multiroom: when a following radio's key asks for a source the leading one\n  doesn't have (say Spotify), the pressed radio takes over and the group\n  carries on with its music.",
      "channels": [
        "bench"
      ],
