    {
      "version": "0.4.0",
      "seq": 40099,
      "date": "2026-10-20T17:28:26Z",
      "created": "2026-10-20T17:24:53Z",
      "kind": "minor",
      "prerelease": false,
      "notes": "- Music in several rooms: Haslers on the same network can play in step\n  (Snapcast). Turn it on in Settings -> Multiroom, then \"Also play on...\" on\n  the front page, or give a key \"Join another Hasler\". Keys on a following\n  radio control the whole group (or leave it - a setting); volume, tone and\n  standby stay with each radio. Off by default; grouped, sound starts about\n  1 s after a key press.\n- AirPlay works: shairport-sync (classic AirPlay) is installed by bootstrap,\n  started by moOde as before.\n- A casting target's own reason (\"not installed\") is shown.",
      "channels": [
        "bench"
      ],
