    {
      "version": "0.3.5",
      "seq": 30599,
      "date": "2026-10-20T03:19:02Z",
      "created": "2026-10-20T03:15:29Z",
      "kind": "patch",
      "prerelease": false,
      "notes": "- Key page: easier to read (contrast), bigger buttons, settings grouped\n  (Sound, Connections, Pilot lamp, Knobs, About this radio, Keys); Next is\n  greyed out where it can't skip; the offline view is dimmed; lighter polling.\n- Faster and steadier: the radio no longer runs a heavy moOde tool every\n  second, reads the keys and knobs with fewer transfers, and survives a\n  glitch on the cabinet cable instead of restarting.\n- Settings files are written safely (power cuts), clearer errors, and an\n  \"off\" update mode written by hand is understood.",
      "channels": [
        "bench"
      ],
      "halted": [],
